<p>Panic your enemies within a range of 4 for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 6, 7, 7</acronym> turns. Anyone who fails to make a mental save against your Mindpower has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 30%, 33%, 37%, 40%</acronym> chance each turn of trying to run away from you.</p>